---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Daksh Sharma"
  description="Daksh Sharma is a senior product designer working where AI, health, and high-craft interfaces meet, from research and strategy through to shipped UI."
>
  <article class="about">
    <a class="about__back" href="/">← Home</a>

    <header class="about__head">
      <p class="about__kicker">About</p>
      <h1 class="about__title">Daksh Sharma</h1>
      <p class="about__lead">
        Senior Product Designer working where AI, health, and high-craft
        interfaces meet, building the whole thing from strategy to ship.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="about__body">
      <p>
        I work end to end, from research and strategy through to shipped,
        high-craft UI. My focus is the place where AI and health meet: tools
        people actually have to trust with their bodies and their data, where a
        confident wrong answer is worse than no answer at all.
      </p>
      <p>
        Most recently, as sole product designer at GoodFlip (TatvaCare), I
        designed Kaira, an AI food-logging companion, and the GoodFlip CGM
        dashboard, both shipped to people managing chronic metabolic conditions.
        I owned the problem definition, the interaction and visual design, and,
        for the AI surfaces, the logic and language of what the product actually
        says back.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about__cta">
      <a class="about__link about__link--primary" href="/#work">See my work</a>
      <a class="about__link" href="/Daksh_Sharma_Resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download resume</a>
    </div>
  </article>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  /* Light reading surface for the About page. */
  body:has(.about) {
    background-color: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-xl) var(--space-3xl);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .about__back {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: var(--font-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted);
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .about__back:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .about__head {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .about__kicker {
    font-size: var(--font-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .about__title {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .about__lead {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    font-size: var(--font-lg);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .about__body {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }
  .about__body p {
    font-size: var(--font-md);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }
  .about__body p:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .about__cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }
  .about__link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .about__link:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .about__link--primary {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
